WEBVTT

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:00.729
located in the American vocal cords

00:06:00.753 --> 00:06:02.753
that can be snipped right out.

00:06:03.355 --> 00:06:06.188
It's not, and it can't.

00:06:06.728 --> 00:06:09.028
And I learned this
from talking to my students.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:12.552
So next time class met,

00:06:12.576 --> 00:06:14.123
I apologized,

00:06:14.147 --> 00:06:16.940
and I made an announcement.

00:06:16.964 --> 00:06:18.698
I would have a new policy.

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:23.903
Students would see the word
in my PowerPoints,

00:06:23.927 --> 00:06:26.934
in film, in essays they read,

00:06:26.958 --> 00:06:31.767
but we would never ever
say the word out loud in class.